        "gggpET45PL4_text": "<p><strong>Accepted Payment Methods:</strong></p><p>Amun Organics offers secure payment options for a seamless shopping experience. We accept:</p><ul><li>Major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover)</li><li>PayPal</li><li>Apple Pay &amp; Google Pay</li><li>Other secure payment methods as displayed at checkout</li></ul><p><strong>Order Processing &amp; Payment Authorization:</strong></p><ul><li>Payments are processed at the time of purchase to ensure order confirmation.</li><li>All transactions are encrypted and secured for your protection.</li><li>If a payment fails, please check your details and try again or contact your payment provider.</li></ul><p><strong>Pricing &amp; Currency:</strong></p><ul><li>All prices listed are in <strong>[currency]</strong>, and applicable taxes will be calculated at checkout.</li><li>Amun Organics reserves the right to adjust prices due to market fluctuations, promotions, or supplier costs.</li></ul><p><strong>Billing &amp; Transaction Security:</strong></p><ul><li>Your payment details are never stored on our servers. We use trusted third-party payment processors for secure transactions.</li><li>In case of suspicious or fraudulent transactions, we may request additional verification before processing an order.</li></ul><p><strong>Refunds &amp; Cancellations:</strong></p><ul><li>Orders cannot be canceled once they have been processed. Please double-check your order before completing payment.</li><li>Refunds are only applicable in cases of damaged or incorrect items, as per our Returns Policy.</li></ul><p>For any payment-related inquiries, feel free to contact our support team at <strong>[insert contact email]</strong>.</p>"
